cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "gnn4buoyancy-mwe: a multigrid V-cycle as message-passing layers"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kadeethum
    given-names: Teeratorn
    email: meen.kadeethum@siemens-energy.com
version: 1.2.1
date-released: '2026-09-15'
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/teeratornk/multigrid-gnn"
abstract: >-
  Minimal working example accompanying "Classical finite-element solvers as
  differentiable graph programs on GPUs": the fixed-weight algebraic multigrid
  pressure solve expressed as message-passing layers, with the test suite that
  verifies the graph execution reproduces the multigrid algebra it represents. It
  also keeps the tables, figures and text moved out of the paper's Supplementary
  Information, as data with code that renders and checks them.
# The paper this software accompanies. All nine authors are listed, in manuscript order.
# A deposit platform ingests this block verbatim and renders it as the citation, so a
# short list here misattributes the paper wherever the software is indexed.
